source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The pair ending the line is the token's last run, so Jira shows the earlier pair and breaks at the end; jiro reads two literal backslashes and a trailing hard break.
-- input.jira --
x\\y\\
-- rendered.html --
<p>x\\y<br class="atl-forced-newline" /></p>
-- want.md --
x\\\\y\
-- warnings.json --
[]
